# [CORE](../wg/core.html)

## Summary

The CoRE Working Group held an interim meeting prior to IETF 127. The meeting focused on two primary topics: a proposed new CoAP response code (2.06 No Content) designed to handle resource lifecycles where a resource exists without a current representation (such as in CoAP PubSub), and open design issues in the CoAP Management Interface (CORECONF / COMI) specification (`draft-ietf-core-comi`).

